---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ApproxNote from '../components/ApproxNote.astro';
import Disclaimer from '../components/Disclaimer.astro';
import AnnualContrast from '../components/AnnualContrast.jsx';
import snapRR from '../lib/snapshot_view.js';
// ADR-292/286: фактическая ставка НИКОГДА не пишется руками — один источник, из снимка.
import { realizedPhrase as realizedPhraseRR, realizedApyQualified as realizedLabelRR } from '../lib/realized_rate.js';
const realizedEn = realizedPhraseRR(snapRR);
const realizedRu = realizedPhraseRR(snapRR, true);
const realizedNumEn = realizedLabelRR(snapRR);
const realizedNumRu = realizedLabelRR(snapRR, true);
import { measuredDrawdownWindow } from '../lib/realized_rate.js';
const ddWinEn = measuredDrawdownWindow(false), ddWinRu = measuredDrawdownWindow(true);

/*
 * Annual Contrast — the owner's SHAREABLE sales one-pager.
 *
 * A clean page the owner can open in front of a prospect to SHOW "here is what chasing 15%
 * really costs — and here is our steady live paper book at the realized rate (near the ~3.4% RWA floor),
 * walked through the same year." The two equity
 * curves, the aggressive book's drawdowns DATED + labelled by event, and the side-by-side
 * contrast table all render from the <AnnualContrast /> React island, which fetches
 * /api/aggressive-lab/annual-contrast (served VERBATIM, fail-CLOSED).
 *
 * HONESTY CONTRACT (mirrors the dashboard + the data contract):
 *   - The steady realized-rate line is the desk's REAL conservative book (stable_apy_pct/source from the
 *     data) — an honest baseline, not a flattering fake. Its source is shown on the page.
 *   - A missing/offline contrast file → honest "unavailable", NEVER a fabricated chart.
 *   - Drawdown annotations carry their REAL dates+events; realized vs modeled are visually distinct.
 *   - PAPER / ADVISORY / OUTSIDE-RiskPolicy — these are the strategies the desk REFUSES, shown with
 *     their real risk. NEVER live-allocated, NEVER on the go-live track.
 *
 * The island is client:load so it mounts + starts polling (~15s) immediately. The static intro +
 * disclaimer below render server-side so the page is presentable even before the island hydrates
 * (and the island itself shows an honest "unavailable" if the API is offline — never blank, never
 * a fake curve). EN|RU via the site's data-ru mechanism.
 */
---

<Layout
  title={`The cost of chasing 15.00% — vs the desk's steady ${realizedNumEn} | earn-defi.com`}
  description={`A full year, dated: the 10.00-15.00% aggressive strategies the desk REFUSES, shown with their real drawdowns labelled by event (the 2025-10 USDe unwind, the 2026-04 rsETH depeg), against the desk's steady ${realizedNumEn} simulated paper book (virtual capital) (near the ~3.40% RWA floor) conservative book over the same window. Paper / advisory / outside RiskPolicy — the strategies we refuse, shown with their real risk. Never live-allocated.`}
  canonical="https://earn-defi.com/annual-contrast"
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <ApproxNote />

    <!-- ===================================================== a. THE PITCH (static, SSR) -->
    <section class="pt-20 pb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono"
           style="background:rgba(242,109,109,.10);border:1px solid rgba(242,109,109,.30);color:var(--danger)">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:var(--danger)" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span data-ru="Вне RiskPolicy · advisory · только бумага">Outside RiskPolicy · advisory · paper-only</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight" style="color:var(--text-primary)"
          data-ru={`Сколько на самом деле стоит погоня за 15,00 % — против стабильных ${realizedNumRu} деска`}>
        What chasing 15.00% actually costs — vs the desk's steady {realizedNumEn}
      </h1>

      <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" style="color:var(--text-secondary)"
         data-ru={`Полный год, с датами — по бэктесту. Каждая 10,00-15,00 % стратегия, о которой спрашивают, показана с датированным −X%, который она несёт в бэктесте. Для сравнения — ${ddWinRu}. Окна разные, и это сказано прямо.`}>
        A full year, dated — from a backtest. Every 10.00-15.00% strategy the desk gets asked about, shown with the dated
        <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">−X%</strong> it carries in the backtest. For comparison:
        <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">{ddWinEn}</strong>. The windows differ, and we say so.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="rounded-xl p-5" style="background:var(--bg-surface);border:1px solid var(--border)">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-2" style="color:var(--text-muted)"
             data-ru="Метод (чтобы вы могли нас проверить)">Method (so you can check us)</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--text-secondary)"
             data-ru="Одна дата старта, один номинал, одно окно для обеих сторон. Агрессивные кривые — реальный бэктест лаборатории 2024–2026. Стабильная кривая компаундит РЕАЛЬНУЮ ставку консервативной книги деска — честная базовая линия, не заниженная. Просадки показаны двумя способами и всегда подписаны: фактическая (realized) и модельная (modeled) — мы их не смешиваем и не выдумываем.">
            Same start date, same notional, same window for both sides. The aggressive curves are the
            lab's real 2024–2026 backtest. The stable curve compounds the desk's <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">REAL</strong>
            conservative-book rate — an honest baseline, not a lowballed strawman. Drawdowns are shown
            two ways, always labelled: <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">realized</strong> and
            <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">modeled</strong> — never blended, never invented.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl p-5" style="background:var(--bg-surface);border:1px solid var(--border)">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-2" style="color:var(--text-muted)"
             data-ru="Что это, по-честному">What it is, plainly</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--text-secondary)"
             data-ru="Это стратегии, которые деск ОТКЛОНЯЕТ, показанные с их реальным риском — чтобы выбор был информированным. Paper / advisory / вне RiskPolicy. Никогда не аллоцируются в live, никогда не на go-live треке. Каждая цифра прослеживается до data/aggressive_lab/annual_contrast.json — детерминированно, LLM запрещён.">
            These are the strategies the desk <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">refuses</strong>,
            shown with their real risk so the choice is informed. Paper / advisory / outside RiskPolicy —
            never live-allocated, never on the go-live track. Every figure traces to
            <code style="color:var(--text-muted)">data/aggressive_lab/annual_contrast.json</code> —
            deterministic, LLM-forbidden.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================================================== b. THE LIVE ISLAND (curves + dated DD + table) -->
    <section class="py-8 border-t" style="border-color:var(--border)">
      <!-- Renders from /api/aggressive-lab/annual-contrast; honest "unavailable" if offline, never a fake curve. -->
      <AnnualContrast client:load />
    </section>

    <!-- ===================================================== c. THE BOTTOM LINE (static, SSR) -->
    <section class="py-10 border-t" style="border-color:var(--border)">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-3" style="color:var(--text-muted)"
         data-ru="Честный итог">The honest bottom line</p>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" style="color:var(--text-secondary)"
         data-ru={`В бэктесте каждая агрессивная книга заканчивает год выше — это и покупает хедлайн. Но путь оплачен датированными просадками: unwind USDe в 2025-10 и депег rsETH в 2026-04 проявляются на 15,00 % стороне с датами и глубиной из бэктеста. Для сравнения — ${ddWinRu}. Размен такой: погоня за 15,00 % несёт свой хвост; ${realizedNumRu} на бумаге — с начала трека, рядом с ~3,40 % RWA-полом (ориентир). Это исследование, не оферта: реальный капитал не принимается.`}>
        In the backtest, every aggressive book ends the year higher — that is what the headline buys. But the
        path is paid for in dated drawdowns: the 2025-10 USDe unwind and the 2026-04 rsETH depeg show
        up on the 15.00% side with dates and depths from the backtest. For comparison: {ddWinEn}. The
        trade-off: chasing 15.00% carries its tail; {realizedNumEn} on paper (track-to-date, near the ~3.40% RWA floor, a reference) is the measured alternative. This is research, not an offer: live capital is not open.
      </p>
    </section>

    <Disclaimer />
  </main>
</Layout>
